{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53212","headline":"诗偈 三十七 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 三十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圆镜朗如日，涌出无碍智。\n梵语波罗蜜，唐家无量义。\n说者说无相，离者离文字。\n但说无上道，利他还自利。\n若能入理行，不动到如地。\n缘事常区区，不如展脚睡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53212.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53212","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}